&lt;p&gt;With our hot coral cards and get-paid-early feature, combined with financial education on social media and our award winning customer service, we have a long history of creating magical moments for our customers!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re not about selling products - we want to solve problems and change lives through Monzo ❤️&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;📍London/Cardiff/UK Remote | 💰£115,000 - £145,000&amp;nbsp; + equity + Incentive Awards tied to your performance + &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/careers/&quot;&gt;Benefits&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp; ✨&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Mobile team⭐&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Monzo, we believe managing your mobile plan should feel as simple and transparent as managing your money. With Monzo Mobile, we’re bringing that experience to connectivity, helping customers stay connected with a product that feels intuitive, flexible and genuinely useful.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’ve launched our mobile offering and are now focused on the next phase of growth. That means reaching more customers, improving how they discover and engage with Monzo Mobile, and exploring how we can serve broader connectivity needs over time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🔑You’ll play a key role by...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Product Lead, you’ll help shape the direction of Monzo Mobile as a business and product area. You’ll work across Product, Engineering, Design, Data, Marketing, Operations and Customer Experience to set strategy, drive execution and ensure we’re investing in the right opportunities to deliver meaningful customer and commercial outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an opportunity to lead a high-potential product area at Monzo, combining the pace and ambiguity of building something relatively new with the reach of a trusted brand. You should be excited about setting direction in uncertain spaces, leading through influence, and translating strategy into high-quality execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Setting the product strategy for Monzo Mobile, identifying where we can win in connectivity and translating that into clear priorities, bets and trade-offs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Owning growth and business performance for the area, using customer, market and data insight to drive adoption, engagement and retention.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leading multiple workstreams across the product area, ensuring teams are focused on the highest-impact opportunities and that short-term delivery ladders up to longer-term goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partnering closely with Marketing, Operations and Customer Experience to improve the end-to-end customer journey and ensure the product scales effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building a strong understanding of the commercial drivers of the business to inform investment decisions, prioritisation and partner choices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working with external partners where needed to improve customer experience, delivery outcomes and commercial effectiveness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influencing senior stakeholders across Monzo and aligning adjacent teams around a coherent vision for the space.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coaching and raising the bar for product thinking, execution and decision-making across the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🤩 We’d love to hear from you if…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ve led and scaled consumer digital products or product areas with meaningful customer and business impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re able to set strategy in ambiguous spaces and translate it into clear execution plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re highly analytical and comfortable using data to identify opportunities, make decisions and measure impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re commercially minded and can balance customer value with business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re excellent at influencing senior stakeholders and aligning multiple teams behind a shared direction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You care deeply about customer experience and know how to make complex products feel simple.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ve led large, cross-functional initiatives and are comfortable operating across product, marketing, operations and technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re thoughtful, low-ego and excited by what we’re building at Monzo.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🙌 What’s in it for you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💰 £120,000 - £140,000&amp;nbsp; range ➕Incentive Awards tied to your performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;✈️ We’ll help you relocate to the UK.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;✅ We can sponsor your visa.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📍This role can be based in our London office, but we&#39;re open to distributed working within the UK (with ad hoc meetings in London)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;⏰ We offer flexible working hours and trust you to work enough hours to do your job well, and at times that suit you and your team.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📚 £1,000 learning budget each year to use on books, training courses and conferences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🏡 We will set you up to work from home; all employees are given Macbooks and for fully remote workers we will provide extra support for your work-from-home setup.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;➕ Plus lots more! &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/careers/&quot;&gt;Read our full list of benefits&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🌈&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; The application journey has 4 key steps&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recruiter Call&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Initial Call with Hiring Manager&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Final Loop, consisting of x 3 hour long interviews to assess Project Walkthrough, Case Study and Leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our average process takes around 4-6 weeks but we will always work around your availability. You will have the chance to speak to our recruitment team at various points during your process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have some guidelines on using Artificial Intelligence (AI) to ace an application and interview at Monzo. &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/blog/the-ultimate-guide-on-using-ai-to-ace-an-interview-at-monzo&quot;&gt;You can read them here.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-CM2&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal opportunities for everyone&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Diversity and inclusion are a priority for us and we’re making sure we have lots of support for all of our people to grow at Monzo. At Monzo, we’re embracing diversity by fostering an inclusive environment for all people to do the best work of their lives with us. This is integral to our mission of making money work for everyone. You can read more in our &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/blog/diversity-and-inclusion&quot;&gt;blog&lt;/a&gt;, 2026 &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/blog/our-2026-diversity-and-inclusion-report&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Diversity and Inclusion Report&lt;/a&gt; and 2025 &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/blog/gender-pay-gap-report-2025&quot;&gt;Gender Pay Gap Report.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re an equal opportunity employer. All applicants will be considered for employment without attention to age, ethnicity, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, family or parental status, national origin, or veteran, neurodiversity or disability status.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a preferred name, please use it to apply. We don&#39;t need full or birth names at application stage 😊&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

40abbf845dbfcf8b.description:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;🚀 We’re on a mission to make money work for everyone.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re waving goodbye to the complicated and confusing ways of traditional banking.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;After starting as a prepaid card, our product offering has grown a lot in the last 10 years in the UK. As well as&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/current-account/personal&quot;&gt;personal&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/business-banking&quot;&gt;business&lt;/a&gt; bank accounts, we offer &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/current-account/joint-account&quot;&gt;joint accounts&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/current-account/16-17&quot;&gt;accounts for 16-17 year olds&lt;/a&gt;, a &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/current-account/under-16s&quot;&gt;free kids account&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/flex&quot;&gt;credit cards&lt;/a&gt; in the UK, with more exciting things to come beyond. Our UK customers can also &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/savings&quot;&gt;save&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/investments&quot;&gt;invest &lt;/a&gt;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/pensions&quot;&gt;combine their pensions&lt;/a&gt; with us.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With our hot coral cards and get-paid-early feature, combined with financial education on social media and our award winning customer service, we have a long history of creating magical moments for our customers!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re not about selling products - we want to solve problems and change lives through Monzo ❤️&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;📍London or UK Remote | 💰 &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/documents/engineering-progression-framework-v4-1.pdf&quot;&gt;Engineer III&lt;/a&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Compensation: £85,000 - £110,000 +&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Incentive Awards tied to your performance + &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/careers/&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; | &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/blog/technology&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Technology&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About our Engineering Teams:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have around 650 engineers across Monzo who design and build our in-house banking platform. We have big ambitions for the future, and technology plays a big role in creating a bank our customers want, so engineers at Monzo collaborate across disciplines to solve interesting challenges throughout the company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;These range from the products our customers use everyday to underlying infrastructure, security, payments and finance, customer operations, financial crime, and data, to name just a few areas. As a bank, there is scope for impact across a huge number of opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How we work 💻&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our main tech hub is in London, but our engineers live everywhere in the UK— from Brighton to the Western Isles.&amp;nbsp;We value meeting in person but we don&#39;t have a mandated requirement on office attendance, even if you&#39;re nearby. We believe you&#39;ll do your best work if you are where you want to be. If you live outside of London and we ask you to come into the office, Monzo will support you with the costs ✨&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our offices are naturally social, especially Tuesdays, Wednesdays and Thursdays, which happen to line up with our twice-weekly Monzo lunches &amp;amp; treat Thursdays 🍽️&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Teams also schedule time together often for work and play – in or around the office, or online.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Set up a work schedule that delivers impact and fits your life:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Monzo, we value connections, flexibility, and wellbeing. We keep our meetings during core hours to stay connected and believe in maintaining work/life balance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll be empowered to manage your work in a way that suits you and your team, giving you the freedom for children drop-offs and pick-ups, walking your dog or adventurous cat, avoiding peak commuting times or gym slots, appointments, or supporting your family in an emergency 🕣✨&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you prefer to work part-time, we&#39;ll make this happen whenever we can - whether this is to help you meet other commitments or strike a great work-life balance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work the way that works for you with Monzo! 💼&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You should apply if:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;you have strong experience working on the backend of a technology product&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;you want to be involved in building a product that you (and the people you know) use every day&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;you have a product mindset: you care about customer outcomes and you want to make data-informed decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;you’re comfortable working in a team that deals with ambiguity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;you’re interested in distributed systems and writing resilient software&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;you have some experience with strongly-typed languages (Go, Java, C, Scala etc.).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;you think you’d enjoy the kind of work we’re doing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re on the look out for L40 Engineers at the moment, you can read more in our &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/documents/engineering-progression-framework-v4-1.pdf&quot;&gt;Engineering Progression Framework&lt;/a&gt; you will be interviewed across the whole framework, so if you&#39;re not sure what level you&#39;re aiming for chat to your recruiter!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Not ticking every box? That’s totally okay! Studies show that women and people of colour might hesitate to apply unless they meet every single requirement. At Monzo, we’re dedicated to creating a diverse and welcoming team. If you’re passionate about this role and keen to learn and grow with us, we encourage you to apply— even if you don’t have everything thats listed just yet. Drop us your application, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll be working on:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We hire very technically agnostic so &lt;strong&gt;whilst we use the below technologies we do not expect prior knowledge&lt;/strong&gt;, you will be fully supported in our organised onboarding to get up to speed in the below:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://golang.org/&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Go&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; to write our application code (there’s an excellent interactive Go tutorial &lt;a href=&quot;https://tour.golang.org/welcome/1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;here&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://cassandra.apache.org/&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cassandra&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; for most persistent data storage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://kafka.apache.org/&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kafka&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; for our asynchronous message queue&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://kubernetes.io/&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kubernetes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.docker.com/&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Docker&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; to schedule and run our services&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.envoyproxy.io/&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Envoy Proxy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; for RPC&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://aws.amazon.com/&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AWS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; for most of our production infrastructure and&lt;a href=&quot;https://cloud.google.com/&quot;&gt; &lt;strong&gt;GCP&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; for most of our data infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;React for our public web apps and internal tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We also have physical datacenters with actual cables to connect to various third parties&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Interview Process:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our interview process involves three main stages:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Initial Call&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take home task or pair coding exercise&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Final interview: including a system design and a behavioural interview&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our average process takes around 4 weeks but we will always work around your availability.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;One of our engineers has written a detailed blog on their experience through this process, for extra details, hints and tips please see&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/blog/2022/03/23/demystifying-the-backend-engineering-interview-process&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;here&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s in it for you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💰 &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;£85,000 - £110,000&lt;/span&gt; base salary &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;+&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Incentive Awards tied to your performance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;✈️ We can help you relocate to the UK&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;✅ We can sponsor visas.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📍This role can be based in our London office, but we&#39;re open to distributed working within the UK (with ad hoc meetings in London).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;⏰We offer flexible working hours and trust you to work enough hours to do your job well, at times that suit you and your team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📚Learning budget of £1,000 a year for books, training courses and conferences&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;➕And much more, see our full list of benefits &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/careers/&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;here&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We&#39;re usually always hiring for Backend Engineers, so there&#39;s no closing date for this job.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Remote&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-ZM1&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal opportunities for everyone&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Diversity and inclusion are a priority for us and we’re making sure we have lots of support for all of our people to grow at Monzo. At Monzo, we’re embracing diversity by fostering an inclusive environment for all people to do the best work of their lives with us. This is integral to our mission of making money work for everyone. You can read more in our &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/blog/diversity-and-inclusion&quot;&gt;blog&lt;/a&gt;, 2026 &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/blog/our-2026-diversity-and-inclusion-report&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Diversity and Inclusion Report&lt;/a&gt; and 2025 &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/blog/gender-pay-gap-report-2025&quot;&gt;Gender Pay Gap Report.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re an equal opportunity employer. All applicants will be considered for employment without attention to age, ethnicity, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, family or parental status, national origin, or veteran, neurodiversity or disability status.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a preferred name, please use it to apply. We don&#39;t need full or birth names at application stage 😊&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

e3e8752d98ed9225.description:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW142035299 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW142035299 BCX0&quot;&gt;Resolve to Save Lives (RTSL)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; is a global health organization that partners locally and globally to create and scale solutions to the world’s deadliest &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;health threats. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Millions of people die from preventable health threats. We collaborate to close the gap between proven, life-saving solutions and the people who need them. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Since 2017, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;we’ve&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; worked with governments and other partners in more than 60 countries to save millions of lives. We work toward a future where people live&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;longer, healthier lives, communities flourish, and economies thrive. This is an ambitious vision, and it inspires us and our partners to make progress every day.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW70040856 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;Resolve to Save Lives (RTSL) works with governments and partners to strengthen and transform primary health care (PHC) to improve health and save lives. Our approach focuses on making PHC more prioritized, proactive and accountable for outcomes, and strengthening how care is organized, delivered, financed and measured. Drawing on expertise across RTSL&#39;s portfolio, we bring together solutions in health system resilience and epidemic readiness, digital health and data-driven decision-making, performance measurement and improvement, and sustainable health financing. We apply these capabilities to address priority health challenges, including cardiovascular health, maternal survival and sexual and reproductive health, while strengthening health systems to deliver more equitable, effective and resilient care. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW70040856 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;Position Purpose&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Director, Maternal &amp;amp; Reproductive Health will provide strategic and technical leadership for RTSL&#39;s portfolio to reduce preventable maternal deaths and improve sexual and reproductive health outcomes. The role will lead the development and implementation of a multi-country program that strengthens government capabilities to identify and address barriers to quality care, translate data into action, and deliver measurable improvements in health outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Director will have overall accountability for the strategy, resources, quality, performance, and results of the maternal survival and reproductive health portfolio, leading a multidisciplinary team and working closely with governments, technical partners, and colleagues across RTSL to design, implement and scale evidence-informed approaches. The role requires deep expertise in sexual, reproductive and maternal health, strong program leadership, and the ability to translate technical evidence into practical, sustainable health system improvements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Location: &lt;/strong&gt;100% Remote with travel as stated.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Duration:&lt;/strong&gt; Full-time employment for a fixed term of 24 months.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW70040856 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;Core Duties and Responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Leadership&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;and Portfolio Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set the strategic direction, priorities and implementation approach for RTSL&#39;s maternal survival and reproductive health portfolio, exercising delegated authority to make program investment, resource allocation, and partnership decisions within approved organizational parameters and in alignment with country priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee a multi-country portfolio, with accountability for program planning, budget development and management, resource allocation, performance and delivery against strategic objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and manage a multidisciplinary team, establishing clear responsibilities and performance expectations, overseeing staffing and talent development, addressing performance and capacity gaps, and building the capabilities needed for sustained program delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Leadership and Program Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide expert technical leadership across maternal survival and sexual and reproductive health, including maternal death surveillance and response, quality maternal care, family planning, and adolescent pregnancy prevention.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the development and adaptation of evidence-informed approaches that connect data-driven learning with targeted improvements in clinical care, service delivery and wider health system capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide the design and implementation of country programs, identifying opportunities to strengthen government leadership, institutional capabilities and sustainable approaches to improving health outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive innovation and collaboration across RTSL&#39;s technical teams, drawing on expertise in PHC delivery, digital health, measurement and financing to address priority health system bottlenecks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Country Engagement and Strategic Partnerships&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead senior-level engagement with Ministries of Health and national partners to identify priorities, shape country strategies and secure government ownership of programs and results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and manage strategic partnerships with donors, multilateral agencies, technical institutions and implementing partners, identifying opportunities for collaboration, investment and program expansion, and representing RTSL in high-level technical and policy discussions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance, Learning and Accountability&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain overall accountability for portfolio performance and results, establishing clear performance expectations and monitoring mechanisms, and using evidence and implementation learning to inform strategic decisions, address delivery challenges, and adapt approaches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee the generation, synthesis and dissemination of evidence and practical learning to inform policy, program improvement and scale-up across countries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced degree in medicine, public health, sexual and reproductive health, obstetrics and gynecology, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 15 years of relevant global health experience, including substantial technical and leadership experience in sexual, reproductive and maternal health in low- and middle-income countries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience developing and leading complex, multi-country programs, including strategic planning, budget oversight and accountability for results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience engaging senior government officials, donors and international partners, with the ability to build relationships and influence strategic decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills &amp;amp; Abilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recognized technical expertise in maternal survival and reproductive health, with a strong understanding of evidence-based interventions, health service delivery and health system strengthening.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to lead and develop multidisciplinary teams and manage programs across different countries and organizational functions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of data-driven program improvement, implementation challenges and approaches to translating evidence into sustainable results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent strategic thinking, judgement, communication and leadership skills, with the ability to navigate complex political and operational environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in English required; proficiency in French desirable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel internationally, approximately 30% during program start-up and up to 25% thereafter.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation and Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Resolve to Save Lives prides itself on cultivating a supportive, connected remote team doing work that matters. We do everything possible to ensure our employees are connected and set up for success.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;The salary range&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;for applicants based in the US&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; is $150,000 to $170,000 annually. The exact offer will be determined by various factors, such as the candidate&#39;s skills and experience relative to the requirements of the role. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;For applicants based outside the US&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;, salaries are set according to national labor rates for the international NGO sector.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;In addition to a competitive salary, Resolve to Save Lives provides a generous package of benefits, including:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Health insurance for you and your dependents&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:450,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:75}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Contributions toward retirement&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:450,

d8eba46f000e42e5.description:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Our Purpose&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At SentinelOne, we are driven by a clear purpose: to give the advantage to those who secure our future. As AI reshapes how organizations build, operate, and innovate, the responsibility to protect them becomes more critical than ever. When you join SentinelOne, your work helps protect global enterprises, critical infrastructure, and the technologies shaping tomorrow. If you are motivated by meaningful challenges and want your impact to be real, measurable, and global, you will find purpose here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About Us&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SentinelOne is a company at the intersection of AI and security, pioneering a new operating model for cybersecurity. Our AI-native platform unifies protection across endpoint, cloud, identity, data, and AI systems to deliver autonomous detection and response with clarity and speed. By combining real-time analytics, intelligent automation, and a unified data foundation, we reduce noise, simplify complexity, and empower security teams to focus on what truly matters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our teams are builders, problem-solvers, and innovators committed to shaping the future of security. If you are excited to solve hard problems alongside talented, mission-driven people, we invite you to help us build a safer future for humanity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Are We Looking For?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for people who are relentlessly curious and committed to continuous learning. AI is reshaping every function across our business, and we enable every team member, regardless of role or level, to build fluency in AI tools and concepts. Those who thrive here actively seek out new solutions, experiment thoughtfully, and apply what they learn to drive better, faster, smarter outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;As a Sr. Channel Account Executive, you will be tasked with managing an assigned group of focus partners in the French region where we are rapidly growing our presence and revenues. This role will report into the Senior Director, Channels SEUR. You will manage existing and grow new national focus partners that will allow better market and vertical sales and support coverage&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What will you do?&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Primary responsibilities include&lt;strong&gt;: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement and manage an effective channel strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Increase Partner Generated revenues and Partner Initiated Deals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage existing and grow new national focus partners that will allow better market and vertical sales and support coverage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute account mapping, meetings and demand generation activities with other SentinelOne staff and partners to qualify target accounts and opportunities that will lead to Partner Initiated Deals and POCs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generate monthly, quarterly and yearly planning of sales activities&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead Enablement sessions to train our focus partners to ensure we have self-sufficient partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build up strong relationships with relevant decision makers and key persons within partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support marketing plans and coordination of marketing activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Skills and Knowledge Will You Bring?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ideal candidates will have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of high-tech channel sales experience in an enterprise sales environment, with experience of both resell and MSSP sales motion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track-record of driving continued partner growth and revenue&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of and network within leading French VAR partners&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understands business models of channel partners and knows how to build in our solutions and offerings into Partner offerings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong working knowledge of the cyber security or similar space&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Metrics driven and accountable - takes ownership and responsibility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Can work in a fast paced, start-up environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Great relation and reputation with key partners in assigned region&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to present in front of a bigger audience and to host events with and for partners and end-customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to identify and initiate deals with partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to work on deals and close them with a partner in close sync with SentinelOne Account Teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent French and English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree or equivalent work experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why us?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;AI is redefining how the world operates and rewriting the rules of security in real time, and SentinelOne was built for this moment. From day one, we architected an AI-native platform designed to operate at machine speed, not as an add-on to legacy systems but as the foundation itself. If you want to build where innovation and impact move together, this is that place.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We invest in our Sentinels with comprehensive, competitive benefits designed to support you and your family:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equity &amp;amp; Rewards&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Restricted Stock Units (RSUs)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Stock Purchase Plan (ESPP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Time Off &amp;amp; Wellbeing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive leave benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gender-neutral parental leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Insurance &amp;amp; Financial Security&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Medical and insurance benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Disability insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Assistance Program (EAP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Perks &amp;amp; Flexibility&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Global home office allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mobile phone reimbursement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work-from-home allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;SentinelOne is proud to be an Equal Employment Opportunity and Affirmative Action employer. We do not discriminate based upon race, religion, color, national origin, gender (including pregnancy, childbirth, or related medical conditions), sexual orientation, gender identity, gender expression, age, status as a protected veteran, status as an individual with a disability, or other applicable legally protected characteristics.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;SentinelOne participates in the E-Verify Program for all U.S. based roles.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;To learn more about how we use AI in our hiring process, please review our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://assets.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt53c99b43892c2378/bltca86b3b84e902400/AI-in-Hiring-SentinelOne.pdf&quot;&gt;AI in Hiring Candidate Disclosure&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

ed4029cd54d72fa4.description:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Cato Networks is the converged network and security cloud for the AI era.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:225,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:225,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;As AI reshapes cybersecurity, enterprises face a dual challenge: unlocking AI’s potential while defending against AI-driven attacks. Cato addresses both through a unified, cloud-native platform, providing the visibility and context to prioritize risks and stop threats in real time across users, applications, data, and AI agents.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:225,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:225,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Join us as we scale: take on ambitious technological challenges and shape the next generation of enterprise security at a company trusted by thousands of organizations worldwide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:225,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:225,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a Regional Sales Director who shares our enthusiasm for cybersecurity and SaaS innovation. If you&#39;re ready to take on the challenge of selling cutting-edge solutions to organisations within the Public Sector (Ministries, Central Government Departments and Agencies), we’d love to have you on our team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Sales in Your Territory: &lt;/strong&gt;Own the sales cycle within your assigned region, from prospecting to closing, securing deals with mid-to-large accounts and building lasting relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engage with Decision-Makers: &lt;/strong&gt;Connect with key decision-makers (CIOs, CISOs, CTOs) and align our cybersecurity and SaaS solutions with their business needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Focus: &lt;/strong&gt;Position our solutions as integral to customers&#39; long-term success and become a trusted advisor within your territory.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Manage Sales Cycles: &lt;/strong&gt;Navigate sales cycles of varying lengths, managing multiple stakeholders and maintaining momentum throughout.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leverage Data: &lt;/strong&gt;Use sales intelligence, win-loss analysis, and pipeline metrics to refine strategies for ongoing success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate &amp;amp; Share Knowledge: &lt;/strong&gt;Work alongside the sales team, sharing insights and best practices to drive success within the territory.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner for Growth: &lt;/strong&gt;Develop relationships with local MSSPs, VARs, and other strategic partners to expand market reach and bring solutions to more organizations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stay Informed: &lt;/strong&gt;Stay ahead of industry trends and help position our solutions as leaders in the market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking For:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience&lt;/strong&gt;: 5-10 years of experience in territory sales within cybersecurity, SaaS, or related industries, with proven success in managing sales cycles and engaging with decision-makers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven Success&lt;/strong&gt;: A demonstrated history of consistently meeting or exceeding sales quotas and driving revenue growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Industry Knowledge&lt;/strong&gt;: Strong understanding of cybersecurity, SaaS, or networking solutions, with awareness of current market trends and competitive positioning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Relationship-Driven&lt;/strong&gt;: Ability to build long-term, trust-based relationships with key stakeholders and decision-makers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborative&lt;/strong&gt;: Experience working with partners, MSSPs, VARs, and other strategic collaborators to drive sales and expand business opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-JW1&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

1579e02bd0728e13.description:
&lt;p&gt;Help Datadog reach and engage priority talent through targeted campaigns, programmes and experiences. In this hands-on role, you will build relationships with internal and external audiences and help people connect with relevant opportunities at Datadog..&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will own agreed programmes from planning through delivery and evaluation. Working with the Director of Employer Brand, your regional counterpart in NYC, Recruiting, Employer Brand and Content, and Growth Marketing, you will turn hiring priorities into focused campaigns, useful experiences and clear next steps for participants.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Redesigning programme delivery through AI-native, agentic workflows is a core responsibility. You will turn effective approaches into regular practice and demonstrate improvements in quality, speed and delivery capacity.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Datadog, we place value in our office culture - the relationships and collaboration it builds and the creativity it brings to the table. We operate as a hybrid workplace to ensure our Datadogs can create a work-life harmony that best fits them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and deliver an agreed portfolio of engagement programmes aligned with hiring priorities. Define the audience, objectives, budget and success measures. Anticipate peaks and quieter periods in event demand, balance events with ongoing programmes, and recommend what to prioritise, reduce or stop within available capacity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Redesign engagement programme delivery with agentic workflows. Build, test and improve workflows that use AI agents for segmentation, nurture, follow-up coordination and reporting. Set human review and approval points with relevant partners, protect candidate and employee data, and measure improvements in quality, turnaround time and delivery capacity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run internal marketing and network activation programmes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build segmented nurture journeys that connect talent communities, event attendees and relevant past candidates, including strong candidates whose timing is not yet right. Personally write, build and send newsletters and email campaigns using agreed messaging and assets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan and deliver targeted events and experiences, including referral sessions, small-group dinners, executive experiences and virtual formats.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create practical briefings, playbooks and activation materials that help recruiters, hiring managers and employees use Datadog&#39;s talent messaging, content and networks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver agreed campaigns with Recruiting and People partners that help employees discover relevant internal opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate programme delivery across regions with your counterpart and Recruiting partners.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the delivery and improvement of engagement programmes. Partner with Brand and Content to apply talent messaging and adapt assets for your audiences. Work with Recruiting on candidate engagement and progression.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with Creative, Field Marketing, Community and business leaders where programmes require their involvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish baselines and evaluate programme performance. Work to improve tracking and use the findings to improve programmes and recommend where to invest, adapt or stop.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience in recruitment marketing, lifecycle marketing, community marketing, or recruiting solutions, with programmes you have personally built, launched and improved.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience delivering targeted events and integrated campaigns for clearly defined audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical experience with audience segmentation, nurture journeys and CRM or marketing automation tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong writing and creative judgement, including the ability to turn a message into useful campaigns, emails and activation materials.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing programme budgets, timelines and competing priorities, with clear recommendations when capacity is constrained.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidence interpreting performance data, understanding attribution limits and using evidence to influence stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to build relationships with senior partners, secure commitments and coordinate delivery across teams and regions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to rethink programme delivery, test AI agents and automation, and turn effective approaches into repeatable workflows with appropriate human review.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a high-growth technology company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with recruiting operations and applicant tracking systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Datadog values people from all walks of life. We understand not everyone will meet all the above qualifications on day one. That&#39;s okay. If you’re passionate about technology and want to grow your skills, we encourage you to apply.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits and Growth:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Best-in-breed onboarding&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous global benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Intra-departmental mentor and buddy program for in-house networking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;New hire stock equity (RSUs) and employee stock purchase plan (ESPP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuous professional development, product training, and career pathing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An inclusive company culture, able to join our Community Guilds and Inclusion Talks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Benefits and Growth listed above may vary based on the country of your employment and the nature of your employment with Datadog.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;color: white;&quot;&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Datadog:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Datadog is the leading observability and security platform for the AI era, providing businesses with unified visibility across the technology stack to manage complexity at scale. It brings applications, infrastructure, data, models, and security into one place, using AI to detect and resolve issues before they impact customers. Trusted globally by Fortune 500 companies and high-growth AI leaders, Datadog enables businesses to move faster with clarity and confidence. Learn more about #DatadogLife on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/datadoghq/?hl=en&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/datadog&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;LinkedIn,&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://learn.datadoghq.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Datadog Learning Center. &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
